WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.393
Change the fictional review assumption to forty minutes and support to thirty.

00:00:05.393 --> 00:00:08.989
Keep production at thirty and maintenance at ten.

00:00:08.989 --> 00:00:12.135
Total effort becomes one hundred ten minutes.

00:00:12.135 --> 00:00:17.079
At the same thirty-dollar hourly time value, that is fifty-five dollars.

00:00:17.079 --> 00:00:21.123
Add the four-dollar tool allocation to obtain fifty-nine dollars.

00:00:21.123 --> 00:00:25.618
The illustrative sixty-dollar comparison leaves one dollar before missing costs.

00:00:25.618 --> 00:00:32.359
This exposes dependence on support and review assumptions; it does not prove profit or loss.

00:00:32.359 --> 00:00:35.955
A labeled sample scenario expects repeated personal revisions.

00:00:35.955 --> 00:00:40.449
Clarify included review and exclusions, then test that revised scope.

00:00:40.449 --> 00:00:45.842
Use the exact AI request and correct invented figures or demand claims.

00:00:45.842 --> 00:00:54.831
Save the test plan, labeled costs, both checked calculations, hidden cost, unestablished claim and human continue, revise or pause decision.
